# Curated Cursor dotfiles for GitHub.
# Tracks only user-authored rules + personal skills under ~/.cursor.
#
# Explicitly omitted (never commit): projects/, chats/, plugins/ cache,
# skills-cursor/ (bundled Cursor skills), extensions/, MCP & CLI config,
# allow/block lists, prompt history, IDE state, and other local or sensitive data.

/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md

!/rules/
/rules/*
!/rules/**

!/skills/
/skills/*
!/skills/**

.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
